msgstr "**Blur In** — klippet fader inn fra en bevegelsesuskarphet."

#: ../clips.rst:270
msgid ""
"**Bounce In** (Center / From Bottom / Left / Right / Top) — clip bounces as "
"it enters."
msgstr ""
"**Bounce In** (senter / fra bunn / venstre / høyre / topp) — klippet "
"spretter inn."

#: ../clips.rst:271
msgid ""
"**Focus Wipe In** (Circle Expand / Circle Shrink / From Bottom / Left / "
