msgstr "**Spiral In** — klippet roterer inn mens det skaleres opp."

#: ../clips.rst:275
msgid ""
"**Wipe In** (Circle Expand / Circle Shrink / From Bottom / Left / Right / "
"Top) — clip is revealed by a wipe."
msgstr ""
"**Wipe In** (sirkel utvidelse / sirkel krymping / fra bunn / venstre / høyre"
