"for høydepunkter midt i klippet: **Bounce**, **Flash**, **Heartbeat**, "
"**Jello**, **Pulse**, **Rubber Band**, **Shake X**, **Shake Y**, **Swing**, "
"**Tada**, **Wobble**."

#: ../clips.rst:281
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Camera` — simulates camera movement on the clip by animating "
